"右渠"}],"family_path":{"connection":"grandfather","generation_distance":2,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p003","quote":"傳子至孫右渠，所誘漢亡人滋多，又未嘗入見；真番旁眾國欲上書見天子，又擁閼不通。元封二年，漢使涉何譙諭右渠，終不肯奉詔。何去至界上，臨浿水，使御刺殺送何者朝鮮裨王長，即渡，馳入塞，遂歸報天子曰「殺朝鮮將」。上為其名美，即不詰，拜何為遼東東部都尉。朝鮮怨何，發兵襲攻殺何。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji115-001","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行；來源明示父系接線，未名世代以星號保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","ancestor_person_id":"f41_ulg_3u1","parent_person_id":null,"intermediate_person_ids":[null]}},{"id":"f41_ulg_3u1_*AA","label":"長降（朝鮮列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"長降","mention_ids":["c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0142"]},{"surface":"長［降］","mention_ids":["c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0190"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0142","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","quote":"長降"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0190","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","quote":"長［降］"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","quote":"左將軍已并兩軍，即急擊朝鮮。朝鮮相路人、相韓陰、尼谿相參、將軍王唊相與謀曰：「始欲降樓船，樓船今執，獨左將軍并將，戰益急，恐不能與，（戰）王又不肯降。」陰、唊、路人皆亡降漢。路人道死。元封三年夏，尼谿相參乃使人殺朝鮮王右渠來降。王險城未下，故右渠之大臣成巳又反，復攻吏。左將軍使右渠子長降、相路人之子最告諭其民，誅成巳，以故遂定朝鮮，為四郡。封參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji115-002","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行；來源明示父系接線，未名世代以星號保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"f41_ulg_3u1_*A"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","mention_count":16,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m003-0004","c-shiji-11